  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core support to Transparency International in Bosnia and Herzegovina - SIDA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the project is to address issues pertaining to democracy, rule of law, accountability and corruption in Bosnia and Herzegovina. Danish support will be provided as core support to support implementation of TI BiH&#x2019;s Anti-Corruption Strategy 2021-2030, via a delegated cooperation agreement with SIDA, who will be managing the grant. The Anti-Corruption Strategy 2021-2030 is a strategic framework for the actions of Transparency International Bosnia and Herzegovina (TI BiH) that is based on the TI BiH vision and mission.</narrative>
  </description>
